          "value": "Write down the integral that gives the arc length of the curve  $\\mathbf f (t) = \\langle 3 \\sin t, \\: 2\\sin 2t \\rangle$\nfrom $t =\\dfrac {3\\pi} 2$  to $t = 2\\pi.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14052793/assets/574a16e843a9c81e5fc9ddbbe2c0dc2c308ffcac4991bcbf48c7f45b4871c93b.png)",
